          "+        <p class=\"d\">Self-hosted AI code review agent that reviews pull requests on GitLab, Forgejo and GitHub from your own infrastructure.</p>",
          "+        <p class=\"m\"><time datetime=\"2026-08-27\">2026-08-27</time> · via Show HN</p>",
